# Mallets on the arp: marimba with soft to hard strokes (darker and quieter when soft), then glock and kalimba,
# then celesta one octave up; one-step notes, so the release decides how long they ring.
tempo 120
steps 32
tail 1.5
track arp
preset 51 120 0 0 255 45 0 0 128 0 128 195 0 0 0 0 0 0
note 0 C5 1 20
note 1 E5 1 50
note 2 G5 1 80
note 3 C6 1 127
note 4 G5 1 100
note 5 E5 1 60
param p1 102 8
param p2 180 8
param release 80 8
note 8 C6 1 110
note 9 G6 1 90
note 10 E6 1 110
note 11 C7 1 127
param p1 72 16
param p2 115 16
param release 45 16
note 16 A4 1 100
note 17 C5 1 90
note 18 E5 1 100
note 19 A5 1 120
param p1 88 24
param p2 150 24
param release 60 24
note 24 C6 1 100
note 26 E6 1 100
note 28 G6 1 100
note 30 C7 1 100
expect sound 0 31
expect idle 70
expect peak_below -3
